        notes: 'Source text: ''I named her Barra. She looks so like him, does she not, milord? She has his nose, and his hair...'' Ned Stark confirmed: ''She does.'' The infant Barra had fine dark hair, consistent with Robert''s black Baratheon hair. Her mother was a red-haired girl working at Chataya''s brothel in King''s Landing.'
